{"quote_id": "quote_ee6a1f743ea4", "text": "1、遇见你是一场宇宙级的浪漫邂逅。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 1, "source_text_sha256": "1495e99a82231d1944cf692655518e05b34c537848864f4525b9f322a4f1e6c9"}
{"quote_id": "quote_741d4f98632d", "text": "2、你静谧时如深海宁静，笑颜如花绽放于海面，怒意则掀起滔天巨浪。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 3, "source_text_sha256": "3d98b35dbbba5f2c048db67536c6c20cf24d9d9ded8af8ea7f3dc4728c02dacb"}
{"quote_id": "quote_e30da5522a56", "text": "3、我细数着星辰变换、日月更迭，只为迎接与你重逢的那一刻璀璨。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 5, "source_text_sha256": "cd0dcd7fac843766175fe620a0577b6201c0e60f2d6409312056a22c656c6872"}
{"quote_id": "quote_32f4c7f24b11", "text": "4、烟花易冷，流星短暂，但愿望因你而闪耀，期待共赴梦想彼岸。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 7, "source_text_sha256": "6bb7dc41107b9015ef458fd056e26fca8d72c89843ba5c1daa937c81749cfe0b"}
{"quote_id": "quote_77a483a14354", "text": "5、从不是深渊囚禁了你，是你遗忘了月光下的自己，该去追寻光明了。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 9, "source_text_sha256": "54a143ffee4288489b038bc12e98fb1c465b76d1af76f2e7584b70df8fd781c3"}
{"quote_id": "quote_12714301efd0", "text": "6、对于外界喧嚣我从不介怀，只在乎与我并肩站在星光下的人是谁。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 11, "source_text_sha256": "9c00965444cf4705e03d09a11b68149b4df3a4b015f16fc9de1bfa26ec99b98f"}
{"quote_id": "quote_a895c99f2d08", "text": "7、你的偶尔小矫情，在我看来比任何表演都更加真实动人。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 13, "source_text_sha256": "654eded49121a76a1a56c346874824b8fbcc521dc4d31de876d265783c965caf"}
{"quote_id": "quote_cba5e041bdc3", "text": "8、那夜窗边的轻吻，你的哼唱虽略走调，却是我听过最美的旋律。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 15, "source_text_sha256": "351b949fefd6fa7fd4476e165121c1c0441968a7296371a1229c89bad6b2b57a"}
{"quote_id": "quote_216f4a08e2f7", "text": "9、别怕这片海，它曾温柔地以鱼群环绕欢迎你，记得那份初次相遇的悸动吗?", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 17, "source_text_sha256": "233358a073e29e4a77e1589c1bfefc57ec10cfae519de393b95a72e81355ecef"}
{"quote_id": "quote_b8507ee42e7a", "text": "10、若真有神明存在，那神定是以人心为形，助人间烟火更添温馨色彩。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 19, "source_text_sha256": "374944c7c668be073b904e7d1c8602834e1cf064214482571a3f0502ce7c1e52"}
{"quote_id": "quote_049f9745dc9e", "text": "11、看啊!只要心怀希望，即使严冬过后废墟之上也能绽放出生命之花。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 21, "source_text_sha256": "461f8dd8e7863edab894c8b502bdd7be08db7f5ef1bbee098c4844559cf90e29"}
{"quote_id": "quote_cbcf86455a6e", "text": "12、每天都在倒数时光流转，直到那一天——我们终将相见。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 23, "source_text_sha256": "2fedacf5d5d3ae66ecbf07429a72d8afd962ae102f53ef42b06910247148c60f"}
{"quote_id": "quote_0012245c9a89", "text": "13、美好稍纵即逝，唯有及时把握才能不留遗憾在心间。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 25, "source_text_sha256": "02b2ecd527e55bfb19142d49849982ea1f083803969e70961dfd509d9238d607"}
{"quote_id": "quote_7439be2bf5ac", "text": "14、人生舞台聚散离合皆因缘起，保持微笑面对风雨变换吧!", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 27, "source_text_sha256": "a0c4eea47abeb2e4501aefecc6dc57f233cd87368038652a8522c740b897810b"}
{"quote_id": "quote_6720abcac670", "text": "15、来年花开之时我们再约此处赏花可好﹖愿那时你我都能笑对春风。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 29, "source_text_sha256": "5654f48d389b3088385c89e0251bb8036e1c135cc35577c7a144e258f8676c12"}
{"quote_id": "quote_07a82bcb6e64", "text": "16、只要你需要我，随时待命，为你守候每一个重要时刻哦~。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 31, "source_text_sha256": "9b0bb440c4f1b07199906a3d2346cee17e6b7fef53319f40dc9795acfe2a324d"}
{"quote_id": "quote_c1f62f2818d2", "text": "17、只是因为在人群中多看了你一眼，你就把远方的花带给我了!", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 33, "source_text_sha256": "bd385c6577da1f41b345644f8a75f9721ba71aff19957586e5cd9bfdd4bc122f"}
{"quote_id": "quote_225cd71d5224", "text": "18、《恋与深空》，你是我心中永恒的星辰大海。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 35, "source_text_sha256": "a70b519f5cf189fb5ffeeec08004b6a4d30c7fda14269b3ccfb8eea3e46902bc"}
{"quote_id": "quote_66ce382cefa7", "text": "19、等你来，每一天都有了意义;想见你，一刻也等不及到明天。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 37, "source_text_sha256": "3f229674af1a097c65191bd9fcedae412ecbd78827941217171fede2cc751fd5"}
{"quote_id": "quote_a9b65ef271ff", "text": "20、与你在一起的每个瞬间，都值得被珍藏成永恒的记忆篇章。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 39, "source_text_sha256": "6acab71326a3d2ff2447af720aa49aa352a6f1b214ecd6a041fb012d9190d875"}
{"quote_id": "quote_bcc2216acaf9", "text": "21、其实，我想看的不仅仅是落日余晖，还有你身边的那抹温暖光芒呀。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 41, "source_text_sha256": "d4f840e8dc90b28e50835ba206db5581c4801543afb92488a91fad538e37f918"}
{"quote_id": "quote_95eb0c35a1f1", "text": "22、海风带走了烦恼，留下的是我们的欢笑和彼此心中的那一份坚定信念。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 43, "source_text_sha256": "e0465812552e5e0e13aa7c3150fcbc3e5cd1840d4d48c9e9a8a394df97a1213d"}
{"quote_id": "quote_2b9a954ca46a", "text": "23、爱情是通往未来的钥匙，它能让我们跨越干山万水实现共同的梦。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 45, "source_text_sha256": "8295d668cf59447c8910beb016fe468f5b56b7cf5e324bd729f61f2b9abfd7bd"}
{"quote_id": "quote_7762c7f17da8", "text": "24、你掌心的温度如同海底暖流，终将深深烙印在我心底成为最柔软的角落。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 47, "source_text_sha256": "4df4f45ea1f5477dfc1f989a4e4328eba734ab49b1cce119b8e69fbf38bd9a71"}
{"quote_id": "quote_12168e37894e", "text": "25、为了靠近你我愿意付出所有，哪怕变成人类也要和你共度此生!", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 49, "source_text_sha256": "2cf8aa7039552f875712bb48817fa195883157c61e892b7a87359ce0baa11107"}
{"quote_id": "quote_e837602dc1b8", "text": "26、我的鳞片在月光下闪耀着承诺的光芒，它会永远守护着我们之间的约定。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 51, "source_text_sha256": "14bca64abb16bb4ead88494c8a345943a1bb148529787823ea63ff90e8bc9e4b"}
{"quote_id": "quote_f8ae5ec4c255", "text": "27、拥有无尽生命的我也会有害怕失去的时候，那就是没有你的日子到来之际。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 53, "source_text_sha256": "f8fb584d2a06fac70df64e923f149adcef9e1e9502235853aa5cd841488b4165"}
{"quote_id": "quote_142e7576c0a4", "text": "28、你知道吗?在这浩瀚宇宙中能遇到你是我最美丽的意外收获啦!", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 55, "source_text_sha256": "590fc55e1daa94ab3a3aa7daf6c9798e9d4d15a55192c9982ff884047a932883"}
{"quote_id": "quote_7ee3e8332694", "text": "29、我们的故事就像这海洋一样广阔无垠，充满了未知的可能性和惊喜发现。", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 57, "source_text_sha256": "427c09653a572048bdc83855e51ca2e1b3466b625ba353e0831124167931ef4c"}
{"quote_id": "quote_9f19266ad270", "text": "30、和你一起探索宇宙的奥秘，感受每一次心跳带来的震撼力量真是太棒了!", "source_file": "E:\\Alysia-chat\\qiyu.txt", "source_line": 59, "source_text_sha256": "1150f518204d8ec0f269d92bd0a49d426e2b70ae0e98d69302b9b7dcaaa94dd0"}
